                        "entry_id": "012bc3dc-42c1-3e2c-ac71-57cebb6b86ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of the herbs of genus Sanguisorba (syn. Poterium), including salad burnet (Sanguisorba minor), an herb used in salads and herbal teas."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
